---
import MuMpcLogo from '../../../components/MuMpcLogo.astro';
import videoUrl from './muMPC_full.mp4?url';
import rolloutUrl from './method_videos/01-latent-rollout.mp4?url';
import programUrl from './method_videos/02-condensed-program.mp4?url';
import solverUrl from './method_videos/03-primal-dual-solver.mp4?url';
import robotariumUrl from './result_videos/robotarium_clipped_2x.mp4?url';
import swarmUrl from './result_videos/noref_plan_ibr_ego_left_to_right_2x.mp4?url';
import quadrupedNomUrl from './result_videos/go2_nom_side.mp4?url';
import quadrupedObsUrl from './result_videos/go2_obs_top_down.mp4?url';
import crazyflieUrl from './result_videos/cf_mpc_2x2.mp4?url';
import cubeUrl from './result_videos/cube_real_diffqp_comparison.mp4?url';
import ropeUrl from './result_videos/rope_mpc_2x2.mp4?url';
const methodSteps = [
  { title: 'Precompute the latent rollout', url: rolloutUrl },
  { title: 'Condense the quadratic program', url: programUrl },
  { title: 'Solve with a frozen inverse', url: solverUrl },
];
const subtitle = 'Safe Nonlinear and World Model Control in Microseconds via Koopman-Linearized Pre-Compilation';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#151515" />
    <meta name="description" content={subtitle} />
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex" />
    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" sizes="any" href="/projects/micrompc/favicon.svg" />
    <title>μMPC</title>
  </head>
  <body>
    <main>
      <header>
        <h1><MuMpcLogo /></h1>
        <p class="subtitle">Safe Nonlinear and World Model Control in <span class="highlight">Microseconds</span> via Koopman-Linearized Pre-Compilation</p>
        <p class="authors"><a href="/">Devesh Nath</a><span aria-hidden="true">·</span><span>Glen Chou</span></p>
        <nav aria-label="Project resources">
          {[
            { label: 'Paper', path: 'M14 3H6v18h12V7l-4-4Z M14 3v5h4 M9 12h6 M9 16h6' },
            { label: 'Code', path: 'm8 7-5 5 5 5 M16 7l5 5-5 5 M14 4l-4 16' },
            { label: 'Video', path: 'm8 5 11 7-11 7V5Z' },
          ].map(({ label, path }) => (
            <button type="button" aria-disabled="true" aria-label={`${label}: Coming Soon!`}>
              <span class="resource-label" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d={path} /></svg><span>{label}</span></span>
              <span class="soon" aria-hidden="true">Coming Soon!</span>
            </button>
          ))}
        </nav>
      </header>
      <section id="video" aria-label="μMPC full presentation">
        <video controls autoplay muted playsinline preload="auto" aria-label="μMPC full presentation video">
          <source src={videoUrl} type="video/mp4" />
          Your browser does not support embedded video. <a href={videoUrl}>Download the video</a>.
        </video>
      </section>
      <section class="abstract" aria-labelledby="abstract-title">
        <h2 id="abstract-title">Abstract</h2>
        <p>Expressive models. Microsecond planning. <MuMpcLogo /> precompiles learned Koopman dynamics into a compact, action-only optimization problem whose size is independent of the lifted state dimension. Expensive matrix operations move offline; online control uses matrix–vector products and projections, adapting to new goals and constraints without refactorization.</p>
        <p><MuMpcLogo /> reduces planning latency by one to over two orders of magnitude across benchmarks, enabling sub-millisecond visual world model planning, 4096-dimensional quadruped control in under 5 ms, and collision-aware planning for 200 quadrotors at over 30 Hz. The same framework runs onboard a Crazyflie microcontroller, bringing efficient predictive control from embedded robots to high-dimensional learned models.</p>
      </section>
      <section class="method" aria-labelledby="method-title">
        <h2 id="method-title">Method</h2>
        <div class="method-carousel" role="region" aria-roledescription="carousel" aria-label="Method breakdown" tabindex="0">
          <button class="method-arrow previous" type="button" aria-label="Previous method step" aria-controls="method-slides" disabled>
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m14 6-6 6 6 6" /></svg>
          </button>
          <div id="method-slides">
            {methodSteps.map((step, index) => (
              <figure class="method-card" hidden={index !== 0} role="group" aria-roledescription="slide" aria-label={`${index + 1} of 3: ${step.title}`}>
                <figcaption><span class="method-number">{index + 1} / {methodSteps.length}</span><span>{step.title}</span></figcaption>
                <video muted playsinline preload="auto" aria-label={step.title}>
                  <source src={step.url} type="video/mp4" />
                </video>
              </figure>
            ))}
          </div>
          <button class="method-arrow next" type="button" aria-label="Next method step" aria-controls="method-slides">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m10 6 6 6-6 6" /></svg>
          </button>
        </div>
      </section>
      <section class="results" aria-labelledby="results-title">
        <h2 id="results-title">Results</h2>
        <figure>
          <figcaption><span class="result-number">1 / 5</span><span>Microsecond control. Sub-millisecond world models. 200 agents at 30 Hz.</span></figcaption>
          <img src="/projects/micrompc/assets/results.svg" width="1790" height="713" loading="lazy" alt="Benchmark comparisons of solve times and success rates for quadruped control, linear world models, and 3D quadcopters. μMPC achieves 0.725 ms on bimanual rope planning, 0.427 ms on Reacher, 0.058 ms on CPU quadcopter control, and 32.118 ms for 200 quadcopters." />
        </figure>
        <div class="multi-agent-result">
          <p class="result-summary"><span class="result-number">2 / 5</span><span>Fast, Scalable Multi-Agent Planning</span></p>
          <div class="result-video-pair">
            <figure>
              <video muted playsinline loop preload="metadata" aria-label="Seven differential drive robots planning together">
                <source src={robotariumUrl} type="video/mp4" />
              </video>
              <figcaption>7 physical differential drive robots</figcaption>
            </figure>
            <figure>
              <video muted playsinline loop preload="metadata" aria-label="Collision free planning with 150 quadcopters">
                <source src={swarmUrl} type="video/mp4" />
              </video>
              <figcaption>Collision free planning with 150 Quadcopters</figcaption>
            </figure>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="crazyflie-result">
          <p class="result-summary"><span class="result-number">3 / 5</span><span>Long Horizon (H=75) planning onboard the crazyflie MCU in 24.57 ms</span></p>
          <video muted playsinline loop preload="metadata" aria-label="Long horizon onboard planning on the Crazyflie microcontroller">
            <source src={crazyflieUrl} type="video/mp4" />
          </video>
        </div>
        <div class="multi-agent-result">
          <p class="result-summary"><span class="result-number">4 / 5</span><span>Quadruped Planning</span></p>
          <div class="result-video-pair">
            <figure>
              <video class="quadruped-nominal" muted playsinline loop preload="metadata" aria-label="Quadruped planning with a 4096-dimensional Koopman model">
                <source src={quadrupedNomUrl} type="video/mp4" />
              </video>
              <figcaption>4096D Koopman planning in 4.47 ms</figcaption>
            </figure>
            <figure>
              <video class="quadruped-obstacle" muted playsinline loop preload="metadata" aria-label="Quadruped whole-body safety filtering with a 100-step horizon">
                <source src={quadrupedObsUrl} type="video/mp4" />
              </video>
              <figcaption>Whole-body safety filtering with horizon 100 in 28.18 ms</figcaption>
            </figure>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="multi-agent-result">
          <p class="result-summary"><span class="result-number">5 / 5</span><span>2048D Linear World Models</span></p>
          <div class="result-video-pair">
            <figure>
              <video class="world-model-video" muted playsinline loop preload="metadata" aria-label="Hardware cube manipulation with a model trained using DiffQP">
                <source src={cubeUrl} type="video/mp4" />
              </video>
              <figcaption>Differentiable QP supervision recovers the needed vertical control authority</figcaption>
            </figure>
            <figure>
              <video class="world-model-video" muted playsinline loop preload="metadata" aria-label="Bimanual rope manipulation with a linear world model">
                <source src={ropeUrl} type="video/mp4" />
              </video>
              <figcaption>Bimanual rope manipulation in 0.725 ms</figcaption>
            </figure>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>
    <script>
      document.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>('nav button').forEach((button) => {
        let resetTimer: ReturnType<typeof setTimeout>;
        button.addEventListener('click', () => {
          clearTimeout(resetTimer);
          button.classList.add('show-soon');
          resetTimer = setTimeout(() => button.classList.remove('show-soon'), 1500);
        });
      });
      const carousel = document.querySelector<HTMLElement>('.method-carousel')!;
      const cards = [...carousel.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('.method-card')];
      const previous = carousel.querySelector<HTMLButtonElement>('.previous')!;
      const next = carousel.querySelector<HTMLButtonElement>('.next')!;
      let active = 0;
      let visible = false;
      const finished = new WeakSet<HTMLVideoElement>();
      document.querySelectorAll<HTMLVideoElement>('#video video, .method-card video').forEach((video) => {
        video.loop = false;
        video.addEventListener('ended', () => {
          finished.add(video);
          video.pause();
        });
      });
      const updatePlayback = () => cards.forEach((card, index) => {
        const video = card.querySelector('video')!;
        if (index === active && visible && !finished.has(video) && !video.ended) video.play().catch(() => {});
        else video.pause();
      });
      const showStep = (index: number) => {
        if (index < 0 || index >= cards.length) return;
        active = index;
        cards.forEach((card, i) => {
          card.hidden = i !== active;
          if (i === active) {
            const video = card.querySelector('video')!;
            finished.delete(video);
            video.currentTime = 0;
          }
        });
        previous.disabled = active === 0;
        next.disabled = active === cards.length - 1;
        updatePlayback();
      };
      previous.addEventListener('click', () => showStep(active - 1));
      next.addEventListener('click', () => showStep(active + 1));
      carousel.addEventListener('keydown', (event) => {
        if (event.key === 'ArrowLeft' || event.key === 'ArrowRight') {
          event.preventDefault();
          showStep(active + (event.key === 'ArrowLeft' ? -1 : 1));
        }
      });
      new IntersectionObserver(([entry]) => {
        visible = entry.isIntersecting;
        updatePlayback();
      }, { threshold: 0.25 }).observe(carousel);
      const resultObserver = new IntersectionObserver((entries) => {
        entries.forEach((entry) => {
          const video = entry.target as HTMLVideoElement;
          if (entry.isIntersecting) video.play().catch(() => {});
          else video.pause();
        });
      }, { threshold: 0.25 });
      document.querySelectorAll<HTMLVideoElement>('.results video').forEach((video) => resultObserver.observe(video));
    </script>
  </body>
</html>

<style>
  @font-face { font-family: 'Lato'; src: url('/fonts/Lato-Regular.ttf') format('truetype'); font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; font-display: swap; }
  @font-face { font-family: 'Lato'; src: url('/fonts/Lato-Bold.ttf') format('truetype'); font-style: normal; font-weight: 700; font-display: swap; }
  :global(html) { color-scheme: dark; background: #101214; min-height: 100%; }
  :global(body) { margin: 0; color: #f4f7fb; font-family: 'Lato', sans-serif; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; }
  :global(*) { box-sizing: border-box; }
  main { width: min(100% - 64px, 1000px); margin: 0 auto; padding: 80px 0 72px; }
  header { text-align: center; }
  h1 { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 17px; margin: 0 0 34px; font: 700 80px/1 'Lato', sans-serif; letter-spacing: -3px; }
  .subtitle { max-width: 760px; margin: 0 auto; font-size: 32px; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: -.55px; line-height: 1.4; text-wrap: balance; }
  .highlight { color: #50d6ff; }
  .authors { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 15px; margin: 24px 0 0; color: #b7c0c8; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.6; }
  .authors a { color: inherit; text-decoration: none; }
  .authors a:hover { color: #50d6ff; }
  .authors > span[aria-hidden] { color: #55616c; }
  nav { display: flex; justify-content: center; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 10px; margin: 29px 0 48px; }
  nav button { position: relative; isolation: isolate; overflow: hidden; display: inline-grid; place-items: center; width: 112px; height: 42px; padding: 0; flex: 0 0 112px; border: 1px solid #343c43; border-radius: 24px; background: #1b2025; color: #e5ebef; font: 700 14px/1.4 'Lato', sans-serif; cursor: default; transition: border-color .3s; }
  nav button::before { content: ''; position: absolute; inset: 0; z-index: -1; background: #d3f3fc; transform: translateY(101%); transition: transform .3s cubic-bezier(.22, 1, .36, 1); }
  nav button > span { position: absolute; inset: 0; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; transition: opacity .2s, transform .3s; }
  nav button .resource-label { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 16px 38px; align-content: center; justify-content: center; align-items: center; gap: 8px; line-height: 16px; }
  .resource-label > span { display: block; text-align: left; }
  nav button .soon { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(8px); color: #12252c; font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: .3px; white-space: nowrap; }
  nav button:is(:hover, :focus-visible, .show-soon) { border-color: #d3f3fc; }
  nav button:is(:hover, :focus-visible, .show-soon)::before { transform: translateY(0); }
  nav button:is(:hover, :focus-visible, .show-soon) .resource-label { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(-8px); }
  nav button:is(:hover, :focus-visible, .show-soon) .soon { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
  :is(a, button):focus-visible { outline: 2px solid #50d6ff; outline-offset: 5px; }
  nav svg { display: block; width: 16px; height: 16px; flex: 0 0 16px; fill: none; stroke: currentColor; stroke-width: 1.6; stroke-linecap: round; stroke-linejoin: round; }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { nav button, nav button::before, .resource-label, .soon { transition: none; } }
  #video { scroll-margin-top: 24px; border-top: 1px solid #2b3035; padding-top: 40px; }
  video { display: block; width: 100%; aspect-ratio: 16 / 9; background: #000; }
  .abstract { margin: 48px auto 0; border-top: 1px solid #2b3035; padding-top: 40px; }
  .abstract > p { max-width: 760px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; }
  .abstract h2 { text-align: center; margin: 0 0 22px; font-size: 26px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -.3px; }
  .abstract p { text-align: justify; hyphens: auto; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 18px; color: #b7c0c8; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.8; }
  .method { margin-top: 48px; border-top: 1px solid #2b3035; padding-top: 40px; }
  .method h2 { text-align: center; margin: 0 0 28px; font-size: 26px; letter-spacing: -.3px; }
  .method-carousel { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 44px minmax(0, 800px) 44px; gap: 24px; align-items: center; justify-content: center; }
  .method-card { margin: 0; }
  .method-card[hidden] { display: none; }
  .method-card figcaption { display: flex; align-items: baseline; justify-content: center; gap: 12px; margin: 0 0 20px; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.5; text-align: center; }
  .method-number { flex-shrink: 0; color: #50d6ff; font-size: inherit; letter-spacing: normal; }
  .method-arrow { display: grid; place-items: center; width: 44px; height: 44px; padding: 0; border: 1px solid #343c43; border-radius: 50%; background: #1b2025; color: #e5ebef; cursor: pointer; margin-top: 47px; }
  .method-arrow:hover:not(:disabled) { border-color: #50d6ff; color: #50d6ff; }
  .method-arrow:disabled { opacity: .25; cursor: default; }
  .method-arrow svg { width: 22px; height: 22px; fill: none; stroke: currentColor; stroke-width: 1.6; stroke-linecap: round; stroke-linejoin: round; }
  .results { margin-top: 48px; border-top: 1px solid #2b3035; padding-top: 40px; }
  .results h2 { text-align: center; margin: 0 0 28px; font-size: 26px; letter-spacing: -.3px; }
  .results figure { margin: 0; }
  .results img { display: block; width: 100%; height: auto; }
  .results figcaption, .result-summary { display: flex; align-items: baseline; justify-content: center; gap: 12px; max-width: 860px; margin: 22px auto 0; color: #f4f7fb; font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.6; text-align: center; text-wrap: balance; }
  .result-number { flex-shrink: 0; color: #50d6ff; font-size: inherit; letter-spacing: normal; }
  .multi-agent-result, .crazyflie-result { margin-top: 56px; }
  .crazyflie-result video, .quadruped-nominal, .quadruped-obstacle, .world-model-video { background: transparent; }
  .result-video-pair { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 24px; }
  .result-video-pair figcaption { display: block; margin-top: 14px; font-size: 16px; }
  .results > figure > figcaption, .result-summary { margin: 0 auto 24px; }
  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    main { width: calc(100% - 36px); padding: 52px 0 36px; }
    h1 { font-size: 64px; gap: 13px; margin-bottom: 28px; }
    .subtitle { font-size: 25px; letter-spacing: -.35px; line-height: 1.4; }
    .authors { margin-top: 23px; font-size: 16px; gap: 12px; }
    nav { gap: 8px; margin: 25px 0 34px; }
    nav button { width: 94px; flex-basis: 94px; }
    #video { padding-top: 28px; }
    .abstract { margin-top: 32px; padding-top: 28px; }
    .abstract p { font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.75; }
    .method { margin-top: 32px; padding-top: 28px; }
    .method-carousel { grid-template-columns: 32px minmax(0, 1fr) 32px; gap: 8px; }
    .method-arrow { width: 32px; height: 32px; margin-top: 56px; }
    .method-card figcaption { font-size: 14px; gap: 8px; margin: 0 0 14px; min-height: 42px; }
    .results { margin-top: 32px; padding-top: 28px; }
    .results figcaption, .result-summary { margin-top: 18px; font-size: 17px; }
    .multi-agent-result, .crazyflie-result { margin-top: 36px; }
    .result-video-pair { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 28px; }
    .result-video-pair figcaption { margin-top: 12px; font-size: 15px; }
    .results > figure > figcaption, .result-summary { margin: 0 auto 20px; }
  }
</style>
